    <briefdescription>
<para>Internal renderer responsible for building and updating QSGNode line geometry for a <ref refid="classQAccelPlot_1_1LineCurve" kindref="compound">LineCurve</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Supports solid and dashed lines, gradient stroke, gradient fill, and optional pre-built vertex caches assembled on the main thread for reduced render-thread stalls. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
